# Pokémon Battle UI - Classic & Interactive

Here's a self-contained HTML file that recreates a nostalgic Pokémon battle UI with interactive elements. It includes:
- Classic battle screen layout
- Animated sprites
- Health bars
- Move selection
- Turn-based combat
- Sound effects
- Nostalgic music

